EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University to request an application fee waiver.

Application fee waivers are only available for Arizona residents who currently attending high school and will be first-time freshmen at ASU. The fee waiver can be requested from your high school guidance counselor. Application fee waivers are not available for nonresidents.

Please let me know if I can assist with anything else.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
